{"title": "Blood (surface)", "pageid": 2015, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Blood_(surface)", "categories": ["Surfaces", "Areas"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">\"Blood\" redirects here. For other uses, see <a href=\"/wiki/Blood_(disambiguation)\" title=\"Blood (disambiguation)\">Blood (disambiguation)</a>.    </div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 200px\" class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Blood_surface.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Blood_surface.png/300px-Blood_surface.png.webp, /w/images/0/0b/Blood_surface.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Blood (surface) image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Blood_surface.png/300px-Blood_surface.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Blood_surface.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Blood</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Surface\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Surface\">surface</a> that is commonly created when living creatures receive damage.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>Douses unprotected flames. Can be frozen.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/38px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Condition Type Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Type: <a href=\"/wiki/Area#Surface\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area\">Surface</a></dd>\n\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creation\">Creation</span></h2>\n<p>This area can be created by the following:\n</p><p>Items:\n</p>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r347748\">.mw-parser-output .div-col{margin-top:0.3em;column-width:20em}.mw-parser-output .div-col>ul{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .div-col-rules{column-rule:1px solid #aaa}.mw-parser-output .div-col dl,.mw-parser-output .div-col ol,.mw-parser-output .div-col ul{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .div-col li,.mw-parser-output .div-col dd{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}</style><div class=\"div-col\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bloodbank_Bottle\" title=\"Bloodbank Bottle\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Jar_of_Coagulated_Blood_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Jar_of_Coagulated_Blood_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4e/Jar_of_Coagulated_Blood_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Jar_of_Coagulated_Blood_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4e/Jar_of_Coagulated_Blood_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Jar_of_Coagulated_Blood_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Jar_of_Coagulated_Blood_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Jar_of_Coagulated_Blood_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4e/Jar_of_Coagulated_Blood_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Bloodbank_Bottle\" title=\"Bloodbank Bottle\">Bloodbank Bottle</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jar_of_Coagulated_Blood\" title=\"Jar of Coagulated Blood\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Jar_of_Coagulated_Blood_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Jar_of_Coagulated_Blood_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4e/Jar_of_Coagulated_Blood_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Jar_of_Coagulated_Blood_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4e/Jar_of_Coagulated_Blood_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Jar_of_Coagulated_Blood_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Jar_of_Coagulated_Blood_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Jar_of_Coagulated_Blood_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4e/Jar_of_Coagulated_Blood_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Jar_of_Coagulated_Blood\" title=\"Jar of Coagulated Blood\">Jar of Coagulated Blood</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vial_of_Blood\" title=\"Vial of Blood\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Vial_of_Blood_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Vial_of_Blood_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Vial_of_Blood_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Vial_of_Blood_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Vial_of_Blood_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Vial_of_Blood_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Vial_of_Blood_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Vial_of_Blood_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/74/Vial_of_Blood_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Vial_of_Blood\" title=\"Vial of Blood\">Vial of Blood</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Interactions\">Interactions</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Will freeze over into <a href=\"/wiki/Ice_(area)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ice (area)\">ice</a> when exposed to cold damage. After <span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2 turns, thaws into <a href=\"/wiki/Water_(area)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Water (area)\">water</a>.</li></ul>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Cannot be electrified.</li>\n<li>When blood is created by a creature receiving damage, the spread and surface area of blood is determined by the type and quantity of damage.<sup class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">[<a href=\"/wiki/bg3wiki:Verification\" title=\"bg3wiki:Verification\"><span aria-label=\"Needs verification.\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"bg3wiki-help-tooltip\"><i>verify</i></span></a>]</sup></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202045\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplication